        "payload": "tree 42cee582a6964ad62a55c2f0633a49a540cf2463\nparent 4d86d9cc7ed0b623170a78986c57aa75ba6a46c0\nauthor Hennadii Stepanov <32963518+hebasto@users.noreply.github.com> 1787152862 +0100\ncommitter Hennadii Stepanov <32963518+hebasto@users.noreply.github.com> 1787152862 +0100\n\nci: Make `test_bitcoin-qt.exe` output visible\n\nWhen run in the GHA environment, there is no console attached, so Qt's\n`stderrHasConsoleAttached()` returns false and the entire test report is\nlost. Set `QT_ASSUME_STDERR_HAS_CONSOLE=1` to override the detection, as\ndocumented in Qt's `qlogging.cpp`.\n",
